<doc id="75768" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=75768" title="Adam Lambert">
Adam Lambert

Adam Mitchel Lambert (#ALIH), &lt;a href="penyanyi"&gt;penyanyi&lt;/a&gt;, penulis tetembangan, &lt;a href="aktor"&gt;aktor&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="San%20Diego%2C%20California"&gt;San Diego&lt;/a&gt;, Kalifornia, ning sasi &lt;a href="M%C3%A8i"&gt;Mèi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2009"&gt;2009&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké dadi juara kang kaping loro &lt;a href="American%20Idol"&gt;American Idol&lt;/a&gt;.
Dhèwèké lair ning &lt;a href="Indianapolis"&gt;Indianapolis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Indiana"&gt;Indiana&lt;/a&gt;, ibuné nyambut gawé dadi désainer interior lan bapané program manajer,
Lambert gedhé ning kalangan &lt;a href="Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt;.
Bakat musiké terasah amarga Lambert sok nembang ning acara-acara kaagamaanné.
Awit umur 10 taun Lambert wus ngenal dunya panggung teater.
Dhèwèké wus meluni macem-maceming kasting kanggo mainaké peran teater kaya ta YOU'RE A GOOD MAN, lan CHARLIE BROWN.
Ora namung dadi aktor teater, Lambert uga nyambi dadi vokalis band rock kang diwangun déning Lambert, &lt;a href="The%20Citizen%20Vein"&gt;The Citizen Vein&lt;/a&gt;.
Awit taun &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt; Lambert kanthi rutin tampil ning Upright cabaret lan The Zodiac Show kang diproduseri déning &lt;a href="Carmit%20Bachar"&gt;Carmit Bachar&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Pussycat%20Doll"&gt;Pussycat Doll&lt;/a&gt;.
Karir &lt;a href="musik"&gt;musik&lt;/a&gt; internasionalé kang dimulai nalika Lambert meluni audisi &lt;a href="AMERICAN%20IDOL"&gt;AMERICAN IDOL&lt;/a&gt; mangsa kaping wolu ning &lt;a href="California"&gt;California&lt;/a&gt;.
Nalika audisi, Lambert nyanyikake tetembangan andeuweni &lt;a href="Queen"&gt;Queen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bohemian%20Rhapsody"&gt;Bohemian Rhapsody&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Rock%20With%20You"&gt;Rock With You&lt;/a&gt;.
Musikalitasé diinspirasi déning para musisi &lt;a href="Madonna"&gt;Madonna&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Queen"&gt;Queen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Michael%20Jackson"&gt;Michael Jackson&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Aero%20Smith"&gt;Aero Smith&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="David%20Bowie"&gt;David Bowie&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Led%20Zeppelin"&gt;Led Zeppelin&lt;/a&gt;.
Ning penampilané kaping pituné, Lambert nembangaké tetembangan &lt;a href="Black%20or%20White%20milik"&gt;Black or White milik&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Michael%20Jackson"&gt;Michael Jackson&lt;/a&gt; lan olih atur sapala kang meriah saka &lt;a href="Paula%20Abdul"&gt;Paula Abdul&lt;/a&gt;,
&lt;a href="Randy%20Jackson"&gt;Randy Jackson&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Kara%20Dioguardi"&gt;Kara Dioguardi&lt;/a&gt;, meski &lt;a href="Simon%20Cowell"&gt;Simon Cowell&lt;/a&gt; nyeyek Lambert kang dianggep 'berlebihan'.
Sawisé dadipemenang juara kaping loro &lt;a href="AMERICAN%20IDOL"&gt;AMERICAN IDOL&lt;/a&gt;, Lambert wiwit ngebrak dunya hiburan karo hit-hit single kaya ta &lt;a href="No%20Boundaries"&gt;No Boundaries&lt;/a&gt;.
Ora namung iku, panampilanné ning &lt;a href="AMERICAN%20IDOL"&gt;AMERICAN IDOL&lt;/a&gt; liwat tetembanga kang dinyanyikaké kanthi versiné dhéwé kang bisa nduduki tangga lagu tenar ning &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt;.
Albumé kang pisanan, For Your Entertainment, dirilis ning taun &lt;a href="2009"&gt;2009&lt;/a&gt; olih atur sapala kang luar biyasa saka &lt;a href="masarakat"&gt;masarakat&lt;/a&gt;.
Amarga tetembangan iku, dhèwèké dikontrak kanggo nyerat soundtrack filem 2012.
Lambert ya iku artis enom saka &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt; pisan kang ora isin ngakuni maring &lt;a href="masarakat"&gt;masarakat&lt;/a&gt; amarga orientasi seksualé.
Foto ciumané karo priya sempet nyebar ning &lt;a href="masarakat"&gt;masarakat&lt;/a&gt; lan olih tanggepan kang warna-warna.
