Angelina Jolie

Angelina Jolie (#ALIH-jeneng laire Angelina Jolie Voight) Aktris kang duwé profesi &lt;a href="modh%C3%A8l"&gt;modhèl&lt;/a&gt; iki dikenal dadi duta Perserikatan Bangsa Bangsa (PBB) babagan urusan perdamaian donya.
Putri saka pasangan &lt;a href="Jon%20Voight"&gt;Jon Voight&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Marchelina%20Bertrand"&gt;Marchelina Bertrand&lt;/a&gt; iki wiwit kariré dadi modhèl nalika umur 14 taun ning LA, &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="London"&gt;London&lt;/a&gt;.
Rong taun sawisé, dhèwèké nyoba akting ning teater.
Saka teater dhèwèké wiwit merambah ning layar lebar.
Debut layar lebar profesionalé dimulai ning taun &lt;a href="1993"&gt;1993&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="CYBORG%202"&gt;CYBORG 2&lt;/a&gt; kang dilanjutaké &lt;a href="WITHOUT%20EVIDENCE"&gt;WITHOUT EVIDENCE&lt;/a&gt;,
&lt;a href="HANCKERS"&gt;HANCKERS&lt;/a&gt; ning taun &lt;a href="1995"&gt;1995&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="MOJAVE%20MOON"&gt;MOJAVE MOON&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="LOVE%20IS%20ALL%20THERE%20IS"&gt;LOVE IS ALL THERE IS&lt;/a&gt; ning taun &lt;a href="1996"&gt;1996&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="PLAYING%20GOD"&gt;PLAYING GOD&lt;/a&gt; ning taun &lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="PUSHING%20TIN"&gt;PUSHING TIN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="BONE%20COLLECTOR"&gt;BONE COLLECTOR&lt;/a&gt; ning taun &lt;a href="1998"&gt;1998&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="GIRL"&gt;GIRL&lt;/a&gt;,
&lt;a href="INTERUPTED"&gt;INTERUPTED&lt;/a&gt; ning taun &lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="GONE%20IN%20SIXTY%20SECONDS"&gt;GONE IN SIXTY SECONDS&lt;/a&gt; ning taun &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;.
Jolie, kagolong artis kang paling larang bayarané.
Panghasilané, ditaksir dibayar ora kurang saka US$30 juta utawa kurang luwih padha karo Rp.255 miliyar luwih.
Nanging jenengé milai kondhang ning &lt;a href="Hollywood"&gt;Hollywood&lt;/a&gt; nalika dolanan filem laga LARA CROFT: TOMB RAIDER (2001) lan ORIGINAL SIN (2001).
Salanjuté, Jolie uga dolanan ning filem LIFE OR SOMETHING LIKE IT (2002), LARA CROFT TOMB RAIDER: THE CRADLE OF LIFE (2003),
BEYOND BORDERS (2003), TAKING LIVES (2004), SHARK TALE (2004), SKY CAPTAIN AND THE WORLD OF TOMORROW (2004).
Kondhangé dadi aktris &lt;a href="Hollywood"&gt;Hollywood&lt;/a&gt; dimanfaataké kanggo kagiyatan sosial.
Kampanyé perdamaian kang ditujukaké kanggo &lt;a href="masarakat"&gt;masarakat&lt;/a&gt;.
Jolie duwé karemenan ngadopsi bayi kang ora kerawat saka nagara-negra ning dunya.
Dhèwèké ngadopsi &lt;a href="Maddox%20Chivan%20Jolie-Pitt"&gt;Maddox Chivan Jolie-Pitt&lt;/a&gt; kang lair ning tanggal &lt;a href="5%20Agustus"&gt;5 Agustus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt; lan diadopsi ning tanggal &lt;a href="19%20Januari"&gt;19 Januari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Kamboja"&gt;Kamboja&lt;/a&gt;)
uga &lt;a href="Pax%20Thien%20Jolie-Pitt"&gt;Pax Thien Jolie-Pitt&lt;/a&gt; kang lair ning &lt;a href="Vietnam"&gt;Vietnam&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="29%20November"&gt;29 November&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt; lan diadopsi ning tanggal &lt;a href="15%20Maret"&gt;15 Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;.
Uga ngadopsi bayi kang jenenge &lt;a href="Zahara%20Marley%20Jolie-Pitt"&gt;Zahara Marley Jolie-Pitt&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Ethiopia"&gt;Ethiopia&lt;/a&gt;) kang lair tanggal &lt;a href="8%20Januari%202005"&gt;8 Januari 2005&lt;/a&gt; lan diadopsi tanggal &lt;a href="19%20Januari"&gt;19 Januari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;.
Angelina duwé anak kandung, saka pacaré &lt;a href="aktor"&gt;aktor&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Brad%20Pitt"&gt;Brad Pitt&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Shiloh%20Nouvel%20Jolie-Pitt"&gt;Shiloh Nouvel Jolie-Pitt&lt;/a&gt;, kang dilahiraké ning &lt;a href="Ethiopia"&gt;Ethiopia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="19%20Januari"&gt;19 Januari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;,
sapasang anak kembar &lt;a href="Knox%20Leon%20Jolie-Pitt"&gt;Knox Leon Jolie-Pitt&lt;/a&gt; sarta &lt;a href="Vivienne%20Marcheline%20Jolie-Pitt"&gt;Vivienne Marcheline Jolie-Pitt&lt;/a&gt; dilahiraké ning tanggal &lt;a href="12%20Juli"&gt;12 Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2009"&gt;2009&lt;/a&gt; ning &lt;a href="Nice"&gt;Nice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Perancis"&gt;Perancis&lt;/a&gt;.
Jolie tau nikah karo &lt;a href="aktor"&gt;aktor&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Billy%20Bob%20Thornton"&gt;Billy Bob Thornton&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Jonny%20Lee%20Miller"&gt;Jonny Lee Miller&lt;/a&gt;,
nanging urip bebrayanan iku akire tekan perceraian, saiki karo &lt;a href="Pitt"&gt;Pitt&lt;/a&gt; awit taun &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;.
Ning sajeroné wawangunem, Jolie tau nyebut manawa dhèwèké iku wanita kang biseksual, aktris &lt;a href="Kenny%20Shimizu"&gt;Kenny Shimizu&lt;/a&gt;,
salah satunggaling kanca ning filem kang judhulé FOXFIRE (1996) dadi wanita kang gawé dhèwèké kesengsem.
Ora namung seneng karo bocah cilik, dhèwèké uga seneng karo tato, ning awaké, Jolie duwé 13 tato kang dingerteni karo publik.
Saking quote Tenesse Williams, frasa saking basa &lt;a href="Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;, paribahasan Latin sarta tato Yantra ingkang awujud donga kanggo anaké &lt;a href="Maddox"&gt;Maddox&lt;/a&gt;.
Dhèwèké duwé uga tau ngilangaké tato, kaya ta tato nama mantan bojoné, &lt;a href="Billy%20Bob%20Thornton"&gt;Billy Bob Thornton&lt;/a&gt;, kaya ta gambaré utawa karakter kepaten wonten ing basa &lt;a href="China"&gt;China&lt;/a&gt;, sarta gambar jendela kang ana ing gégéré.
Winten ing filem animasi kang judhulé &lt;a href="KUNG%20FU%20PANDA"&gt;KUNG FU PANDA&lt;/a&gt;, Jolie dadi pangisi suwara kanggo karakter Master Tigress.
tau tampil ning filem drama CHANGELING dadi &lt;a href="Christine%20Collins"&gt;Christine Collins&lt;/a&gt;.
Dhèwèké olih nominasi dadi Best Actress ning ajang BAFTA Award, &lt;a href="London%20Film%20Critics%20Circle%20Award"&gt;London Film Critics Circle Award&lt;/a&gt;, Broadcast Film Critics Association Award sarta Academy Award.
