Good Charlotte ya iku &lt;a href="grup%20musik"&gt;grup musik&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="rock%20and%20roll"&gt;pop&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="musik%20punk"&gt;punk&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Waldorf%2C%20Maryland"&gt;Waldorf&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Maryland"&gt;Maryland&lt;/a&gt;, Tetembangan utawa karawit kang kondhang saka grup musik iki ya iku, "&lt;a href="The%20Anthem"&gt;The Anthem&lt;/a&gt;", "&lt;a href="Girls%20%26amp%3B%20Boys"&gt;Girls &amp; Boys&lt;/a&gt;", lan "&lt;a href="Lifestyles%20of%20the%20Rich%20and%20Famous"&gt;Lifestyles of the Rich and Famous&lt;/a&gt;",Band Rock iki asalAmerika asalé saka &lt;a href="Waldorf"&gt;Waldorf&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Maryland"&gt;Maryland&lt;/a&gt; kang diwangun ning tanggal &lt;a href="1%20April"&gt;1 April&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1996"&gt;1996&lt;/a&gt;.
Jeneng saka grup iki dijpuk saka buku carita bocah "GOOD CHARLOTTE: THE GIRLS OF GOOD DAY ORPHANAGE" kang ditulis déning &lt;a href="Carol%20Beach%20York"&gt;Carol Beach York&lt;/a&gt;.
Aliran musik band iki kadayan déning Blink-182, Sum 41, NOFX, Social Distortion lan Green Day.
Band iki dianggotani déning &lt;a href="Dean%20Butterworth"&gt;Dean Butterworth&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Joel%20Madden"&gt;Joel Madden&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Benji%20Madden"&gt;Benji Madden&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Billy%20Martin"&gt;Billy Martin&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Paul%20Thomas"&gt;Paul Thomas&lt;/a&gt;.
Album kang pisanan dirilis ning taun &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt; lan dadi awalé pangalaman kapisan kanggo grup musik iki.
Album iki isiné telung tetembangan, ya iku Little Things, Motivation Proclamation lan Festival Song.
&lt;a href="Harun%20Escolopio"&gt;Harun Escolopio&lt;/a&gt; tau ddai anggota saka grup band iki, lan bagiyané nyekel piranti musik drama.
Nanging metu sadurungé album kang kaping loroné dirilis.
Album kang kaping loroné THE YOUNG AND HOPELESS dirilis kanggo nggabung karo band saudarané, &lt;a href="Wakefield"&gt;Wakefield&lt;/a&gt;.
Lan posisiné &lt;a href="Harun%20Escolopio"&gt;Harun Escolopio&lt;/a&gt; digantikaké déning &lt;a href="Dusty%20Brill"&gt;Dusty Brill&lt;/a&gt;.
Album kang kaping loroné, THE YOUNG AND HOPELESS dirilis ning taun &lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;.
Albumé laris banget lan payu nganti 4,9 yuta copyané.
Amarga album iki, Good Charlote dadi kondhang.
Single kang dadi unggulan saka grup band iki judhulé &lt;a href="Lifestyles%20of%20the%20Rich%20and%20Famous"&gt;Lifestyles of the Rich and Famous&lt;/a&gt; bisa dadi tetembangan kang paling apik ning kabèh daerah ning dunya.
Album iki uga olih sertifikat triple platinum (telung yuta eksemplar album keedol).
Album kang kateluné, THE CHRONICLES OF LIFE AND DEATH, dirilis ning taun &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;.
Meski ora luwih sukses saka album kang kaping loroné, tetep olih respon kang apik saka panikmat musik.
Albumé bisa kaedol nganti 2,2 yuta eksemplar.
Album ini dianggap nyimpang saka album sadurungé amarga ana komposisi kang ora padha karo album sadurungé.
Album iki tetep bisa ddai peringkat kaping 30 ning &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;, kecuali kanggo lagu &lt;a href="We%20Believe"&gt;We Believe&lt;/a&gt;.
Taun 2005, &lt;a href="Chris%20Wilson"&gt;Chris Wilson&lt;/a&gt; metu saka grup amarga kaséhatané kang terganggu.
Taun 2007
Album GOOD MORNING REVIVAL dirilis.
Prestasi saka album iki kurang luwih padha baé kaya ta album sadurungé.
Sawisé iku album kang kaping limané CARDIOLOGY dirilis ning tanggal &lt;a href="2%20November"&gt;2 November&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2010"&gt;2010&lt;/a&gt;.
Taun &lt;a href="2011"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt;, Good Carlotte gabung karo musisi liyané kanggo ngeramekaké acara &lt;a href="Java%20Rockin%20Land"&gt;Java Rockin Land&lt;/a&gt; ning tanggal 22
nganti tanggal 24 Juli ning &lt;a href="Pasisir%20Karnaval"&gt;Pasisir Karnaval&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Ancol"&gt;Ancol&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jakarta"&gt;Jakarta&lt;/a&gt;.
Taun 2012
Saiki Good Charlotte nenggo arep ngénthasake albun anyar pijudul &lt;a href="Cardiology"&gt;Cardiology&lt;/a&gt;. Rencananipun badhé médhal ing 2 Nopembér 2012.. Good Charlotte saiki namung dadi sekawan (4) wong kémawon. Nanging taksih gadhah garangipun.
