<h2>Sajarah Green Day</h2>
Sajarah Green Day.
Green Day iku wiwitan asmané Sweet Children. Tilas anggotané ya iku wonten Billie Joe, Mike Dirnt, lan Sean Hughes. Banjur, amarga boten wonten pémain drum, banjur Billie Joe ngajak &lt;a href="John%20Kiffmeyer"&gt;John Kiffmeyer&lt;/a&gt; kanggo nderék dadi anggota Sweet Children.
<h2>Paradé musik American Idiot</h2>
Paradé musik American Idiot.
Nalika ing surya taun 2015, Billie Joe, Dirnt, lan Tré Cool diréwangi karo &lt;a href="John%20Roecker"&gt;John Roecker&lt;/a&gt; besut paradé musik American Idiot. Paradé iki uga mundhut saka latar wuri album &lt;a href="American%20Idiot"&gt;American Idiot&lt;/a&gt; kagungané Green Day. Adacara paradé iki bisa dipirsani déning judhul &lt;a href="Heart%20Like%20a%20Hand%20Grenade"&gt;Heart Like a Hand Grenade&lt;/a&gt;.
