Karir.
Tamara misuwur dadi presenter kang wis mimpin akèh acara kaya ta paket acara &lt;a href="ulah%20raga"&gt;ulah raga&lt;/a&gt; ya iku presenter &lt;a href="Italian%20League"&gt;Italian League&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bundesliga"&gt;Bundesliga&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Champion%20Cup"&gt;Champion Cup&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Euro%20Cup"&gt;Euro Cup&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="World%20Cup%202004"&gt;World Cup 2004&lt;/a&gt; lan presenter acara &lt;a href="gosip"&gt;gosip&lt;/a&gt; bareng karo &lt;a href="Teuku%20Edwin"&gt;Edwin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Go%20Show"&gt;Go Show&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="TPI"&gt;TPI&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Game%20Zone"&gt;Game Zone&lt;/a&gt; (TPI), &lt;a href="Ari%20Wibowo"&gt;Ari Wibowo&lt;/a&gt; Cari Pembantu (SCTV), &lt;a href="Boom%20Basket"&gt;Boom Basket&lt;/a&gt; (RCTI), lan &lt;a href="Pernik"&gt;Pernik&lt;/a&gt; (TV7).
Tamara Geraldine éntuk pangaji kategori &lt;a href="Best%20Female%20Sport%20Presenter"&gt;Best Female Sport Presenter&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Panasonic%20Awards"&gt;Panasonic Awards&lt;/a&gt; nganti &lt;a href="5"&gt;5&lt;/a&gt; taun kanthi urut wiwit &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;.
Saliyané 'cuap-cuap', Tamara uga pinter &lt;a href="nulis"&gt;nulis&lt;/a&gt;. Buku kang sepisanan digawé Tamara Geraldine ya iku kumpulan 12 &lt;a href="carkak"&gt;carkak&lt;/a&gt; kang judhulé Kamu Sadar, Saya Punya Alasan untuk Selingkuh Kan Sayang? (2003). Bareng karo &lt;a href="Darwis%20Triadi"&gt;Darwis Triadi&lt;/a&gt;, Tamara uga nggawé &lt;a href="buku"&gt;buku&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="biografi"&gt;biografi&lt;/a&gt; kanggo kanca rakete ya iku buku kang judhule Yuni Shara-35 Cangkir Kopi (2007).
<h2>Kasus</h2>
Kasus.
Pertengahan &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;, Tamara tau duwé urusan karo &lt;a href="pulisi"&gt;pulisi&lt;/a&gt; amarga dilaporaké karo &lt;a href="komedian"&gt;komedian&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Farly%20S.M%20Saerang"&gt;Farly S.M Saerang&lt;/a&gt; kanthi &lt;a href="pasal"&gt;pasal&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="351"&gt;351&lt;/a&gt; ngenani bab penganiayaan. Kadadéan iki nalika &lt;a href="Farly"&gt;Farly&lt;/a&gt; dadi &lt;a href="MC"&gt;MC&lt;/a&gt; ing salah sijiné acara ing &lt;a href="tlatah"&gt;tlatah&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Pekan%20Raya%20Jakarta"&gt;Pekan Raya Jakarta&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kemayoran"&gt;Kemayoran&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jakarta%20Pusat"&gt;Jakarta Pusat&lt;/a&gt;. Farly salah muni jeneng bintang tamu kang kuduné Tamara Geraldine malah dadi &lt;a href="Tamara%20Bleszynski"&gt;Tamara Bleszynski&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging amarga émosi, Tamara Geraldine banjur nggebug pérangan mburi sirahé Farly. Nanging amarga kena ing tilas &lt;a href="23"&gt;23&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="jaitan"&gt;jaitan&lt;/a&gt; kang ana ing sirahé Farly. Farly banjur semaput lan digawa ing &lt;a href="RS%20Mitra%20Kemayoran"&gt;RS Mitra Kemayoran&lt;/a&gt;. Kedadeyan iki ora suwé amarga Tamara lan Farly uga sarujuk kanggo damai.
Tamara Geraldine nikah karo wong lanang kang duwé katurunan &lt;a href="Vietnam"&gt;Vietnam&lt;/a&gt; jenenge &lt;a href="Tien%20Thinh%20Pham"&gt;Tien Thinh Pham&lt;/a&gt;. Tamara nikah tanggal &lt;a href="8"&gt;8&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="September"&gt;September&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;. Tamara lan bojoné banjur njupuk anak angkat kang jenengé &lt;a href="Caskaya"&gt;Caskaya&lt;/a&gt; (kang tegesé anak Peri) kang lair nalika tanggal &lt;a href="29"&gt;29&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Oktober"&gt;Oktober&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;.
