Joshua Suherman (#ALIH) ya iku mantan &lt;a href="penyanyi"&gt;penyanyi&lt;/a&gt; cilik &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané nyanyi, Joshua uga dadi bintang &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt;, bintang &lt;a href="layar%20lebar"&gt;layar lebar&lt;/a&gt;, bintang &lt;a href="iklan"&gt;iklan&lt;/a&gt;, lan dadi &lt;a href="presenter"&gt;presenter&lt;/a&gt;. Karir Joshua dadi penyanyi cilik diwiwiti saka &lt;a href="album"&gt;album&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Cit%20Cit%20Cuit"&gt;Cit Cit Cuit&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1996"&gt;1996&lt;/a&gt;, lan kariré wiwit misuwur kanthi lagu "Air" (kang uga dikenal kanthi jeneng "Diobok-Obok"). Saiki Joshua wiwit diwasa lan wiwit yasa kariré lan ninggalnya image yèn dhèwèké dadi penyanyi cilik.
<h2>Biografi</h2>
Biografi.
Joshua lair nalika tanggal 3 November &lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;. Joshua anak saka pasangan &lt;a href="Jedy%20Suherman"&gt;Jedy Suherman&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Lisa%20Suherman"&gt;Lisa Suherman&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Surabaya"&gt;Surabaya&lt;/a&gt;. Joshua dadi anak pambarep saka sadulur kang cacahé telu ya iku &lt;a href="Joseph%20Suherman"&gt;Joseph Suherman&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Jocelyn%20Suherman"&gt;Jocelyn Suherman&lt;/a&gt;.
Joshua miwiti kariré dadi penyanyi cilik. Joshua wiwit rekaman nyanyi kang sepisanan nalika taun &lt;a href="1995"&gt;1995&lt;/a&gt;, nanging album iki ora diédarké. Akhir taun &lt;a href="1995"&gt;1995&lt;/a&gt; Joshua wiwit nggawe albume kang nomer loro kang judhule Kapal Terbang. Album iki didol nalika sasi Maret taun 1997. Setaun sawisé iku nalika sasi &lt;a href="Maret"&gt;Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1998"&gt;1998&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jojo"&gt;Jojo&lt;/a&gt; (jenenge undangane Joshua) nngawe album kang judhule Air kang nggawe jenenge misuwur. &lt;a href="Album"&gt;Album&lt;/a&gt; sawisé album Air ya iku &lt;a href="album"&gt;album&lt;/a&gt; kang judhule Donat kang didol nalika sasi Maret 1999 lan ana manèh album &lt;a href="Lonjak%20Lonjak"&gt;Lonjak Lonjak&lt;/a&gt;.
Saliyané dadi penyanyi cilik, Joshua uga dikenal dadi juru main sinétron lan layar lebar.&lt;a href="Sinetron"&gt;Sinetron&lt;/a&gt; kang tau dibintangi ya iku Abad 21 (1997), Air Mata Ibu (1998), Natal Putih (1998), Anak Ajaib (2000), lan &lt;a href="Inikah%20Rasanya"&gt;Inikah Rasanya&lt;/a&gt;. Film layar lebar kang tau dibintangi ya iku &lt;a href="Joshua%20oh%20Joshua"&gt;Joshua oh Joshua&lt;/a&gt; (2001). Saliyané iku, Joshua uga dadi bintang &lt;a href="iklan"&gt;iklan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="presenter"&gt;presenter&lt;/a&gt; ing acara &lt;a href="kuis"&gt;kuis&lt;/a&gt;.
