<li>OUT OF AFRICA,</li>
<li>DEATH BECOMES HER,</li>
<li>THE MACHURIAN CANDIDATE,</li>
<li>THE DEVIL WEARS PRADA lan</li>
<li>MAMMA MIA!</li>
</ul>
Meryl tau olih nominasi dadi "Best Actress ning ajang &lt;a href="BAFTA%20Award"&gt;BAFTA Award&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Golden%20Globe%20Award"&gt;Golden Globe Award&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Satellite%20Award"&gt;Satellite Award&lt;/a&gt; lan ajang &lt;a href="Academy%20Award"&gt;Academy Award&lt;/a&gt; amarga perané ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="DOUBT"&gt;DOUBT&lt;/a&gt; kang dirilis ning taun &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt;.
Ning filem iki Meryl berperan dadi Sister Aloysius Beauvier.
Ora namung nomunasi, Meryl uga bisa nggawa balik piala dadi Best Actress ning ajang Broadcast Film Critics Association Award,
Iowa Film Critics Award, &lt;a href="Kansas"&gt;Kansas&lt;/a&gt; City Film Critics Circle Award lan Screen Actors Guild Award.
Ning awal sasi &lt;a href="Juni"&gt;Juni&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2009"&gt;2009&lt;/a&gt;, Meryl olih gelar kurmatan, ya iku Doctorate of Fine Arts kang dianugrahaké déning &lt;a href="Princeton"&gt;Princeton&lt;/a&gt;
nalika ulang taun universitas iki kang kaping-262 amarga pangabdiané ning dunya akting sasuwené dhèwèké berkiprah.
