Pussycat Dolls sempet nepungaké jeneng misuwur, kaya ta &lt;a href="Carmen%20Electra"&gt;Carmen Electra&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Christina%20Aguilera"&gt;Christina Aguilera&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Christina%20Applegate"&gt;Christina Applegate&lt;/a&gt;
