&lt;a href="Carmit%20Bachar"&gt;Carmit Bachar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kimberly%20Wyatt"&gt;Kimberly Wyatt&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ashley%20Roberts"&gt;Ashley Roberts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jessica%20Sutta"&gt;Jessica Sutta&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Melody%20Thornton"&gt;Melody Thornton&lt;/a&gt;.
