Tantowi Yahya (#ALIH). Tantowi Yahya iku salah sijiné &lt;a href="presenter"&gt;presenter&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="tivi"&gt;tivi&lt;/a&gt; kang misuwur jenengé. Saliyané iku, Tantowi Yahya uga dadi &lt;a href="ikon"&gt;ikon&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="musik"&gt;musik&lt;/a&gt; country ing &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;. Tantowi Yahya iku mase presenter kang jenengé &lt;a href="Helmi%20Yahya"&gt;Helmi Yahya&lt;/a&gt;.
Tantowi Yahya iku anak saka pasangan &lt;a href="H.M.%20Yahya%20Matusin"&gt;H.M. Yahya Matusin&lt;/a&gt; lan Hj. &lt;a href="Komariah%20Yahya"&gt;Komariah Yahya&lt;/a&gt;. Tantowi Yahya wiwit cilik pancén duwé kepenginan dadi wong kang misuwur jenengé. Kanggo nggayuh pangimpéné iki, Tantowi Yahya banjur duwé usaha kang tenanan. Wiwit kelas loro &lt;a href="SMU"&gt;SMU&lt;/a&gt; Tantowi Yahya sinau karo mulangaké &lt;a href="basa%20Inggris"&gt;basa Inggris&lt;/a&gt; ing panggonan kang kanggo kursus nalika Tantowi lagi kelas &lt;a href="1%20%28angka%29"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="SMP"&gt;SMP&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karir bisnis</h2>
Karir bisnis.
Lulus SMU &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1979"&gt;1979&lt;/a&gt;, Tantowi kang ngugemi &lt;a href="agama"&gt;agama&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Islam"&gt;Islam&lt;/a&gt; iki banjur ijrah ing kutha &lt;a href="Yogyakarta"&gt;Yogyakarta&lt;/a&gt;. Tantowi banjur kuliah D1 ing akademi Perhotèlan. Sawisé iku, Tantowi Yahya banjur pindah ing &lt;a href="Jakarta"&gt;Jakarta&lt;/a&gt;. Karir kerjané diwiwiti dadi &lt;a href="resepsionis"&gt;resepsionis&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Hot%C3%A8l%20Borobudur%20Jakarta"&gt;Hotèl Borobudur Jakarta&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1982"&gt;1982&lt;/a&gt;. Taun &lt;a href="1984"&gt;1984&lt;/a&gt;, Tantowi banjur pindah ing &lt;a href="Hot%C3%A8l%20Hilton"&gt;Hotèl Hilton&lt;/a&gt;. Taun &lt;a href="1987"&gt;1987&lt;/a&gt;, Tantowi pindah ing perusahaan pita &lt;a href="kaset"&gt;kaset&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="BASF"&gt;BASF&lt;/a&gt;. Amarga usaha kang tenanan, Tantowi banjur éntuk kalungguhan dadi Promotion Manager, kamangka Tantowi lagi kerja rong taun.
Nalika taun &lt;a href="1994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt;, nalika Tatowi metu saka BASF. Iki amarga pabrik iku nutup prodhuksi &lt;a href="kas%C3%A8t"&gt;kasèt&lt;/a&gt;é. &lt;a href="Pabrik"&gt;Pabrik&lt;/a&gt; BASF ing &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; tutup amarga wis ana &lt;a href="teknologi"&gt;teknologi&lt;/a&gt; kang luwih modern ya iku &lt;a href="disc"&gt;disc&lt;/a&gt;).
<h2>Karir donyaning hiburan</h2>
<h3>Presenter</h3>
Karir donyaning hiburan.
Presenter.
Acara tivi kang sepisanan kabawah Tantowi ya iku acara &lt;a href="kuis"&gt;kuis&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Gita%20Remaja"&gt;Gita Remaja&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="TVRI"&gt;TVRI&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1989"&gt;1989&lt;/a&gt;), kang dipandu uga karo &lt;a href="Ani%20Sumadi"&gt;Ani Sumadi&lt;/a&gt;. Jenengé ora mung misuwur ing TVRI nanging uga laris dadi MC (master of ceremony) uing acara-acara. Karir kang paling apik ya iku nalika Tantowi Yahya dadi presenter ing acara kuis kang duwé taraf internasional ya iku &lt;a href="Who%20Wants%20to%20Be%20a%20Millionaire%3F%23Versi%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Who Wants to Be a Millionaire?&lt;/a&gt; kang disiyaraké ing &lt;a href="RCTI"&gt;RCTI&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun (&lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt; nganti &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;). Tantowi Yahya uga éntuk penghargaan dadi The Most Favourite Television Quiz Host ing ajang &lt;a href="Panasonic%20Awards"&gt;Panasonic Awards&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Panasonic%20Awards%202004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Panasonic%20Awards%202005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;. Tantowi uga dadi salah sijiné wong kang nggawé lan uga sekretaris jenderal Indonésian Music Awards Foundation taun &lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt;-2001. Saliyané iku, Tantowi Yahya uga dadi presenter acara &lt;a href="Are%20You%20Smarter%20Than%20a%205th%20Grader%3F"&gt;Are You Smarter Than a 5th Grader?&lt;/a&gt; sadurungé digenténi karo &lt;a href="Nico%20Siahaan"&gt;Nico Siahaan&lt;/a&gt;.
Saliyané iku, Tantowi Yahya uga seneng karo &lt;a href="musik"&gt;musik&lt;/a&gt;. Saking senenge karo musik Tantowi Yahya nganti nggambaraké yèn musik iku dadi agama kang kaping pindho.
