Teuku Ryan Rezky Hamzah utawa Teuku Ryan (#ALIH) ya iku salah sijiné juru main &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;. Teuku Ryan seneng kagiyatan kang ana tantangane kaya ta petualangan. Saliyané iku Teuku Ryan uga seneng plesiran. Teuku Ryan nduwéni profesi dadi &lt;a href="aktor"&gt;aktor&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;. Teuku Ryan ngugemi &lt;a href="agama"&gt;agama&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Islam"&gt;Islam&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng Teuku Ryan wiwit dikenal nalika dhèwèké dadi bintang ing sinétron Shangrilla lan Bella Vista 3.
<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Teuku Ryan miwiti kariré dadi &lt;a href="modh%C3%A9l"&gt;modhél&lt;/a&gt;. Sawisé iku Teuku Ryan banjur njajal nyanyi bareng karo &lt;a href="Ari%20Sihasale"&gt;Ari Sihasale&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Johandy%20Yahya"&gt;Johandy Yahya&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Surya%20Saputra"&gt;Surya Saputra&lt;/a&gt; ing kelompok Cool Colors.&lt;a href="Grup%20musik"&gt;Grup musik&lt;/a&gt; iki banjur nggawé &lt;a href="album"&gt;album&lt;/a&gt; kang judhulé Tataplah (1995). Nalika &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt;, Teuku Ryan metu saka grup musik iki, awit dhèwèké sibuk &lt;a href="syuting"&gt;syuting&lt;/a&gt;. Teuku Ryan banjur digenténi &lt;a href="Ari%20Wibowo"&gt;Ari Wibowo&lt;/a&gt;.
Ryan uga bisa akting. Ryan wiwit dikenal lumantar sinétron Shangrilla dan Bella Vista 3. Kang nggawé jenengé misuwur ya iku aktinge dadi &lt;a href="bocah"&gt;bocah&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="lanang"&gt;lanang&lt;/a&gt; oon nanging diajéni ing &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; Si Yoyo 1 nganti 3. Teuku Ryan uga main filem layar lebar kang judhulé Sesal nalika taun (1995).
<h2>Kauripan pribadi</h2>
Kauripan pribadi.
Teuku Ryan nikah karo juru main &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt; kang jenengé &lt;a href="Vira%20Yuniar"&gt;Vira Yuniar&lt;/a&gt;. Ryan nikah tanggal &lt;a href="6"&gt;6&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Maret"&gt;Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt; sawisé pacaran wiwitan taun &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;. Saka pernikahan iki Ryan laan Vira nduwéni anak kang cacahé loro kang jenengé &lt;a href="Cut%20Sjalinni%20Ryan"&gt;Cut Sjalinni Ryan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Teuku%20Prayaa%20Alcany%20Ryan"&gt;Teuku Prayaa Alcany Ryan&lt;/a&gt;.
Nalika wiwitan sasi &lt;a href="Juli"&gt;Juli&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2009"&gt;2009&lt;/a&gt;, Ryan megat Vira. Pasangan iki wis pisah ranjang nalika tanggal sasi &lt;a href="April"&gt;April&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2009"&gt;2009&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Sidhang"&gt;Sidhang&lt;/a&gt; kang sepisanan kuduné dianakaké nalika tanggal &lt;a href="6"&gt;6&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Juli"&gt;Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2009"&gt;2009&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging amarga bapaké Ryan séda, sidang iku banjur diundur.
