Éric Abidal

Éric Sylvain Abidal (lair 11 September 1979) utawi asring sinebat mawi asma Eric Abidal, inggih punika juru main &lt;a href="bal-balan"&gt;bal-balan&lt;/a&gt; saking nagari &lt;a href="Perancis"&gt;Perancis&lt;/a&gt;. Eric Abidal gadhah posisi minangka bèg tengah ing tim nasional bal &lt;a href="Perancis"&gt;Perancis&lt;/a&gt; lan klub &lt;a href="FC%20Barcelona"&gt;FC Barcelona&lt;/a&gt; saking nagari &lt;a href="Spanyol"&gt;Spanyol&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karier Klub</h2>
Karier Klub.
Abidal gladhèn bal ing &lt;a href="AS%20Lyon%20Duch%C3%A8re"&gt;Lyon-Duchère&lt;/a&gt;, satunggalipun sub tim &lt;a href="Lyon"&gt;Lyon&lt;/a&gt;. Abidal miwiti karier profesionalipun ing klub &lt;a href="Monaco%20FC"&gt;Monaco FC&lt;/a&gt; ing tanggal 16 September 2000, nalika samanten Eric Abidal main ing klub punika sampun 25 adu tandhing. Salajengipun Abidal pindhah dhateng klub &lt;a href="Lille%20OSC"&gt;Lille OSC&lt;/a&gt;. Ing klub punika Abidal saged reuninan kaliyan kancanipun &lt;a href="Claude%20Puel"&gt;Claude Puel&lt;/a&gt;, ing tim punika Abidal main bal cacahipun 62 adu tandhing. Ing pungkasanipun taun 2004, Abidal gantos dhateng klub &lt;a href="Olympique%20Lyonnais"&gt;Olympique Lyonnais&lt;/a&gt;. Ing tim punika, Abidal main bal sesarengan kanca satunggal tim ing tim nasional &lt;a href="Perancis"&gt;Perancis&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Gr%C3%A9gory%20Coupet"&gt;Grégory Coupet&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Fran%C3%A7ois%20Clerc"&gt;François Clerc&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Anthony%20R%C3%A9veill%C3%A8re"&gt;Anthony Réveillère&lt;/a&gt;) lan ugi kaliyan kalih kancanipun saking tim nasional bal &lt;a href="Brazil"&gt;Brazil&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Cristiano%20Marques%20Gomez"&gt;Cristiano Marques Gomez&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ca%C3%A7apa"&gt;Caçapa&lt;/a&gt;).
Tanggal 17 Januari 2007, Abidal saged damel gol lan minangka gol pisanan sadangunipun karieripun. Nalika samanten &lt;a href="Olympique%20Lyonnais"&gt;Olympique Lyonnais&lt;/a&gt; saged ngalahaken &lt;a href="Le%20Mans%20Union%20Club%2072"&gt;Le Mans Union Club 72&lt;/a&gt; kanthi skor pungkasan 1-0. Tetandhingan kasebat kalaksanan ing taun 2006/2007.
Tanggal 30 Juni 2007, Abidal pindhah dhateng klub &lt;a href="FC%20Barcelona"&gt;FC Barcelona&lt;/a&gt; kanthi regi transfer 9 juta Euro. Kontrak punika dangunipun sekawan taun.
