Ritus Antiokhia

Ritus Antiokhia iku sebutan kanggo kumpulan &lt;a href="liturgi"&gt;liturgi&lt;/a&gt; sing mula-mula dipigunakaké ing Patriarkat Antiokhia, ya iku liturgi saka &lt;a href="Konstitusi%20Apostolik"&gt;Konstitusi Apostolik&lt;/a&gt;, banjur &lt;a href="Liturgi%20Santo%20Yakobus"&gt;Liturgi Santo Yakobus&lt;/a&gt; sajeroning &lt;a href="basa%20Yunani"&gt;basa Yunani&lt;/a&gt;, Liturgi Santo Yakobus sajeroning &lt;a href="Basa%20Syria"&gt;Basa Syria&lt;/a&gt;, lan anafora-anafora Syria liyané. Urutan iki isih bisa diterusaké tekan &lt;a href="Ritus%20Byzantium"&gt;Ritus Byzantium&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Liturgi%20Santo%20Basil"&gt;Liturgi Santo Basil&lt;/a&gt; sing luwih tuwa umuré lan &lt;a href="Liturgi%20Santo%20Yohanes%20Krisostomus"&gt;Liturgi Santo Yohanes Krisostomus&lt;/a&gt; sing luwih ringkes), lan liwat liturgi Byzantium tekan tata pangibadahan Gréja Armenia. Nanging ora ana gandhèng-cènèngé manèh karo Antiokhia.

