Alicia Djohar kang kondhang kanthi jeneng Itje (#ALIH). Alicia Johar ya iku salah sijiné juru main &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;. Alicia Johar iku mantan Ratu &lt;a href="Bogor"&gt;Bogor&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1972"&gt;1972&lt;/a&gt;. Alicia Johar tau dadi pemeran utama ing filem &lt;a href="Gadis%20Kampus"&gt;Gadis Kampus&lt;/a&gt;. Ing filem iku, Alicia main bareng karo aktor &lt;a href="Widy%20Santoso"&gt;Widy Santoso&lt;/a&gt; dan &lt;a href="Junaedi%20Salat"&gt;Junaedi Salat&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Pendhidhikan</h2>
Pendhidhikan.
Sawisé lulus &lt;a href="SMA"&gt;SMA&lt;/a&gt;, Alicia banjur mèlu kursus-kursus ing &lt;a href="Singapura"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt;. Alicia kursus suwéné rong taun ya iku nalika taun (1974-1975). Sawisé iku ing taun &lt;a href="1976"&gt;1976&lt;/a&gt; Alicia nutugake pandhidhikané ing babagan kecantikan. Dhèwèké &lt;a href="sekolah"&gt;sekolah&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="London"&gt;London&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Nalika isih SMA, Alicia Johar olèh gelar dadi Ratu Kebaya Bogor (1971) lan Ratu Bogor (1972).
Alicia Johar banjur main filem nalika taun 1972, nalika iku Alicia main dadi figuran ing filem &lt;a href="Perkawinan%20%28filem%29"&gt;Perkawinan&lt;/a&gt; kang disutradarani &lt;a href="Wim%20Umboh"&gt;Wim Umboh&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika akir taun &lt;a href="1975"&gt;1975&lt;/a&gt;, Alicia ditawani main filem saka &lt;a href="Turino%20Djunaidy"&gt;Turino Djunaidy&lt;/a&gt;. Alicia dadi pemeran pembantu ing filem kang judhulé &lt;a href="Ganasnya%20Nafsu"&gt;Ganasnya Nafsu&lt;/a&gt; (1976). Nalika taun &lt;a href="1978"&gt;1978&lt;/a&gt; Alicia dipercaya dadi pemeran utama ing &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Dukun%20Kota"&gt;Dukun Kota&lt;/a&gt; saka produksi &lt;a href="PT%20Japos%20Film"&gt;PT Japos Film&lt;/a&gt;.
Alicia Djohar uga aktif mèlu main sinétron. Ora mung dadi juru main &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt; nanging Alicia uga dadi koordinator kaya ta ing sinétron &lt;a href="Losmen%28serial%20televisi%29"&gt;Losmen&lt;/a&gt; (1985-1987) produksi &lt;a href="TVRI"&gt;TVRI&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané iku, Alicia uga njurung sinétron serial &lt;a href="Karmila"&gt;Karmila&lt;/a&gt; ing taun (1997). Sinetron iki cacahé &lt;a href="26"&gt;26&lt;/a&gt; episode. Sinetron iki diprodhuksi &lt;a href="Avicom%20Production"&gt;Avicom Production&lt;/a&gt;.
Alicia duwé anak kang cacahé telu ya iku &lt;a href="Adytho%20Rumanda"&gt;Adytho Rumanda&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yesica%20Harnescia"&gt;Yesica Harnescia&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Nanditho%20Djohar"&gt;Nanditho Djohar&lt;/a&gt;.
Seminggu sawisé Alicia Johar nikah karo Prof. Dr. H. &lt;a href="Tabrani"&gt;Tabrani&lt;/a&gt; RAB, ana wong wadon kang ngaku dadi bojoné Tabrani. Wong wadon iki jenengé &lt;a href="Syirin%20Saleh"&gt;Syirin Saleh&lt;/a&gt;.
