Kareem Abdul-Jabbar

Kareem Abdul-Jabbar (#ALIH kanthi asma Ferdinand Lewis Alcindor, Jr.) inggih punika salah satunggalipun juru main &lt;a href="ulah%20raga"&gt;ulah raga&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="basket"&gt;basket&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Wekdal alitipun</h2>
Wekdal alitipun.
Abdul-Jabbar dipunlairaken kanthi asma Ferdinand Lewis Alcindor, Jr ing tanggal &lt;a href="16%20April"&gt;16 April&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1947"&gt;1947&lt;/a&gt;, lan ageng ing Kutha &lt;a href="Manhattan"&gt;Manhattan&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;. Kareem putranipun Cora Lillian, ingkang nyambut damel ing satunggaling &lt;a href="toko"&gt;toko&lt;/a&gt;, lan Ferdinand Lewis Alcindor Sr ingkang nyambut damel dados &lt;a href="pulisi"&gt;pulisi&lt;/a&gt; lalu lintas lan juru main &lt;a href="musik"&gt;musik&lt;/a&gt;.
Saderengipun mlebet agami &lt;a href="Islam"&gt;Islam&lt;/a&gt;, Kareem agaminipun &lt;a href="Kristen"&gt;Kristen&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Katulik"&gt;Katulik&lt;/a&gt; lan naté sekolaah ing St. Jude School ing &lt;a href="Inwood"&gt;Inwood&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Manhattan"&gt;Manhattan&lt;/a&gt;. Kareem ndhèrèk organisasi Islam ing taun &lt;a href="1968"&gt;1968&lt;/a&gt;, sadherengipun ngungelaken &lt;a href="syahadat"&gt;syahadat&lt;/a&gt; lan gantos agami dados agami &lt;a href="Islam%20Sunni"&gt;Islam Sunni&lt;/a&gt;.
Sampun wiwit alitipun Kareem katingal wasis anggènipun main basket. Nalika SMA Karem saged damel sekolahipun dados juwara ing Kajuwaraan Katulik ing Kutha &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karier</h2>
Karier.
Kareem ndhèrèk klub basket &lt;a href="University%20of%20California%2C%20Los%20Angeles"&gt;UCLA&lt;/a&gt;, salajengipun karier profésional kanthi mlebet klub &lt;a href="Milwaukee%20Bucks"&gt;Milwaukee Bucks&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Los%20Angeles%20Lakers"&gt;Los Angeles Lakers&lt;/a&gt;. Kareem dados juru main ingkang damel rekor angka ingkang kathah piyambak salaminya kanthi 38.387 poin, lan ngantos sapunika rekor kasebat taksih dipuncepeng Kareem.
