Marissa Nasution (#ALIH) utawa kang kondhang kanthi jenengé VJ Marissa iku &lt;a href="presenter"&gt;presenter&lt;/a&gt; lan juru main &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;. Marissa iku wong &lt;a href="wadon"&gt;wadon&lt;/a&gt; katurunan &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Batak"&gt;Batak&lt;/a&gt; ini
<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Marissa Nasution miwiti kariré nalika mèlu ajang &lt;a href="MTV%20VJ%20Hunt"&gt;MTV VJ Hunt&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging gelar &lt;a href="VJ%20Hunt%202007"&gt;VJ Hunt 2007&lt;/a&gt; durung bisa Marissa cekel, amarga gelar iku dinduwèni déning &lt;a href="Millane%20Fernandez"&gt;Millane Fernandez&lt;/a&gt;, adhik saka &lt;a href="Nino%20Fernandez"&gt;Nino Fernandez&lt;/a&gt; kang setaun sadurungé uga mèlu acara iki.
Ing &lt;a href="reality%20show"&gt;reality show&lt;/a&gt; Katakan Cinta, Marissa kepilih dadi High Quality Jomblo ing episode &lt;a href="Valentine"&gt;Valentine&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;. Ananing sawisé iku, Marissa banjur duwé gayutan karo &lt;a href="Daniel%20Mananta"&gt;Daniel Mananta&lt;/a&gt;. Marissa nasution miwiti kariré nalika Marissa dadi presenter ing acara-acara &lt;a href="MTV"&gt;MTV&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika iku Marissa Nasution dadi bintang tamu utawa Guest VJ. Nanging saiki, Marissa Nasution wis dadi &lt;a href="VJ%20MTV"&gt;VJ MTV&lt;/a&gt;.
Saiki, Marissa wis digawé sibuk karo acara &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sian%20Idol"&gt;Indonésian Idol&lt;/a&gt; ing taun &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt;. Amarga Marissa dadi pembawa acara ngancani mantan pacaré ya iku &lt;a href="Daniel%20Mananta"&gt;Daniel Mananta&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané iku, Marissa uga diiwangi karo &lt;a href="Dewi%20Sandra"&gt;Dewi Sandra&lt;/a&gt;. Marissa lan Dewi nggantékaké &lt;a href="Ata"&gt;Ata&lt;/a&gt;, sawisé &lt;a href="Ata"&gt;Ata&lt;/a&gt; manggon ing &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;. Marissa uga sinau akting ing filem-filem Indonésia. Film kang kapisan dibintangi Marissa Nasution ya iku filem kang judhule &lt;a href="Namaku%20Dick"&gt;Namaku Dick&lt;/a&gt;. Marissa saiki uga dadi VJ MTV kang mimpin acara MTV AMPUH STAIRWAY TO SHOW lan uga mandu acara MANTAP. Marissa uga dadi bintang filem ing filem-filem Indonésia kaya ta &lt;a href="Mau%20Lagi%3F"&gt;Mau Lagi?&lt;/a&gt; (2008), &lt;a href="Mupeng%20%28Muka%20Pengen%29"&gt;Mupeng (Muka Pengen)&lt;/a&gt; (2008), dan yang terakhir ya iku &lt;a href="Janda%20Kembang"&gt;Janda Kembang&lt;/a&gt; (2009).
