<doc id="76293" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=76293" title="Anna Maria">
Anna Maria

Anna Maria Sofyana luwih misuwur kanthi jeneng Anna Maria (#ALIH). Anna Maria ya iku &lt;a href="modhel"&gt;modhel&lt;/a&gt; lan bojoné &lt;a href="aktor"&gt;aktor&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Roy%20Marten"&gt;Roy Marten&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Anna Maria miwiti kariré dadi &lt;a href="modhel"&gt;modhel&lt;/a&gt; ing wiwitan &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1980"&gt;1980&lt;/a&gt;-an. Anna Maria mandheg dadi modhél lan luwih ngrumati kaluwargané sawisé nikah karo Roy Marten. Anna Maria nikah karo Roy Marten nalika &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1985"&gt;1985&lt;/a&gt;.
Jeneng Anna Maria wiwit misuwur nalika taun &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika iku, bojone Annaa Maria kena kasus penyalahgunaan &lt;a href="narkotika"&gt;narkotika&lt;/a&gt;. Ing taun kang padha Anna Maria banjur mbalik dadi modhél. Anna Maria iku anak nomer pitu saka sadulur kang cacahé wolu. Wiwitan Anna Maria kepilih dadi bintang &lt;a href="iklan"&gt;iklan&lt;/a&gt; prodhuk &lt;a href="Tolak%20Angin"&gt;Tolak Angin&lt;/a&gt; kang anyar sawisé &lt;a href="Sophia%20Latjuba"&gt;Sophia Latjuba&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rhenald%20Kasali"&gt;Rhenald Kasali&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wynne%20Prakusya"&gt;Wynne Prakusya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Setiawan%20Djodi"&gt;Setiawan Djodi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="D%C3%A9wa%2019"&gt;Déwa Band&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Subronto%20Laras"&gt;Subronto Laras&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nia%20Ramadhani"&gt;Nia Ramadhani&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nana%20Mirdad"&gt;Nana&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Naysila%20Mirdad"&gt;Naysila Mirdad&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ikang%20Fawzi"&gt;Ikang Fawzi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Marissa%20Haque"&gt;Marissa Haque&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gunawan"&gt;Gunawan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cici%20Tegal"&gt;Cici Tegal&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Lula%20Kamal"&gt;Lula Kamal&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Kauripan pribadi</h2>
Kauripan pribadi.
Anna Maria dhaup karo &lt;a href="Roy%20Marten"&gt;Roy Marten&lt;/a&gt; nalika tanggal &lt;a href="1"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="April"&gt;April&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1985"&gt;1985&lt;/a&gt;. Anna Maria kenal Roy Marten ing salah sawijining acara peragaan busana ing taun &lt;a href="1984"&gt;1984&lt;/a&gt;. Sanajan nalika iku Roy nduwéni status &lt;a href="dhudha"&gt;dhudha&lt;/a&gt; kang nduwé anak cacahé &lt;a href="papat"&gt;papat&lt;/a&gt;. Anna Maria lan Roy Marten umuré béda &lt;a href="12"&gt;12&lt;/a&gt; taun luwih tuwa tinimbang Roy Marten. Nanging kekaroné tetep bisa nyawiji Saka dhaupe karo Roy Marten, Anna nduwé anak loro ya iku &lt;a href="Merari"&gt;Merari&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mahesa%20Gibran"&gt;Mahesa Gibran&lt;/a&gt;, saliyané iku, Anna Maria uga nduwé anak kang cacahé papat saka dhaupe Roy sadurungé ya iku kang jenengé &lt;a href="Monique"&gt;Monique&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href="Aline"&gt;Aline&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Galih"&gt;Galih&lt;/a&gt;, sarta juru main sinétron &lt;a href="Gading%20Marten"&gt;Gading Marten&lt;/a&gt;.
