Brad Pitt

William Bradley "Brad" Pitt (#ALIH) inggih punika &lt;a href="aktor"&gt;aktor&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; ugi dados &lt;a href="prodhuser%20filem"&gt;prodhuser filem&lt;/a&gt; lan aktivis babagan sosial. Pitt sampun pikantuk kalih nominasi kanggé &lt;a href="Penghargaan%20Academi"&gt;Penghargaan Academi&lt;/a&gt; lan sekawan nominasi &lt;a href="Penghargaan%20Golden%20Globe"&gt;Penghargaan Golden Globe&lt;/a&gt;. Panjenenganipun dianggup dados salah satunggalipun tiyang jaler ingkang paling atraktif ing &lt;a href="donya"&gt;donya&lt;/a&gt;, satunggalipun label ingkang dipunparingi saking jagad médhia dhateng Brad Pitt.
<h2>Wekdal alitipun</h2>
Wekdal alitipun.
Pitt punika putranipun Jane Etta Hillhouse, ingkang nyambut damel dados konselor SMA lan William Alvin Pitt, ingkang gadhah usaha truk. Pitt lair ing &lt;a href="Shawnee%2C%20Oklahoma"&gt;Shawnee, Oklahoma&lt;/a&gt;. Kaliyan sadherekipun Doug (lair 1966) dln Jullie Neal (lair 1969). Sasampunipun Pitt lair, kulawarganipun pindhah dhateng &lt;a href="Springfield%2C%20Missouri"&gt;Springfield, Missouri&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karier</h2>
Karier.
Pitt misuwur wiwit taun &lt;a href="1990"&gt;1990&lt;/a&gt;-an sasampunipun dados aktor ing filem &lt;a href="Hollywood"&gt;Hollywood&lt;/a&gt;, ing antawisipun taun &lt;a href="1994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt;, lan filem thriller &lt;a href="Se7en"&gt;Se7en&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1995"&gt;1995&lt;/a&gt;. Brad Pitt naté pikantuk nominasi &lt;a href="Academy%20Awards"&gt;Academy Awards&lt;/a&gt; lan menang ing &lt;a href="Golden%20Globe%20Awards"&gt;Golden Globe Awards&lt;/a&gt;, kekalihipun amargi filem &lt;a href="Twelve%20Monkeys"&gt;Twelve Monkeys&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1996"&gt;1996&lt;/a&gt;. Pitt lajeng main ing filem hit internasional &lt;a href="Ocean%27s%20Eleven"&gt;Ocean's Eleven&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt; lan kaalih sekuelipun &lt;a href="Ocean%27s%20Twelve"&gt;Ocean's Twelve&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ocean%27s%20Thirteen"&gt;Ocean's Thirteen&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;.
