Jessica Alba

Jessica Marie Alba (#ALIH) inggih punika &lt;a href="aktris"&gt;aktris&lt;/a&gt; saking nagari &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;. Alba dados aktris &lt;a href="t%C3%A9l%C3%A9visi"&gt;télévisi&lt;/a&gt; lan aktris filem. Alba miwiti kariripun ing jagad télévisi lan filem &lt;a href="biyoskup"&gt;biyoskup&lt;/a&gt; nalika nembé yuswa 13 taun ing &lt;a href="Camp%20Nowhere"&gt;Camp Nowhere&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="The%20Secret%20World%20of%20Alex%20Mack"&gt;The Secret World of Alex Mack&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt;. Alba langkung misuwur amargi dados paraga ing sérial télévisi &lt;a href="Dark%20Angel"&gt;Dark Angel&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;. Alba lajeng main ing filem-filem ingkang manéka warni kados &lt;a href="Honey%20%282003%20filem%29"&gt;Honey&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sin%20City%20%28filem%29"&gt;Sin City&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Fantastic%20Four%20%28filem%29"&gt;Fantastic Four&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Into%20the%20Blue%20%282005%20filem%29"&gt;Into the Blue&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Good%20Luck%20Chuck"&gt;Good Luck Chuck&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;.
Jessica sampun angsal kanugrahan ingkang manéka warni, kados &lt;a href="Teen%20Choice%20Awards"&gt;Teen Choice Award&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Saturn%20Award%20for%20Best%20Actress%20on%20Television"&gt;Saturn Award for Best Actress on Television&lt;/a&gt;, lan nominasi &lt;a href="Golden%20Globe%20Award"&gt;Golden Globe&lt;/a&gt; kanthi aktingipun ing filem Dark Angel.
Alba lair ing &lt;a href="Pomona%2C%20California"&gt;Pomona, California&lt;/a&gt; saking pasangan Catherine (née Jensen) lan Mark Alba. Ibunipun saking keturunan (&lt;a href="Dh%C3%A8nemarken"&gt;Dhènemarken&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Kanada"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt;), lan ramanipun keturunan (&lt;a href="Meksiko"&gt;Meksiko&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt;). Jessica gadhah sadhèrèk enem &lt;a href="Joshua%20Alba"&gt;Joshua&lt;/a&gt;. Ramanipun nyambut damel ing Angkatan Udara Amérika Sarékat, lan sampun gantos panggènan (griya dhinas) saking &lt;a href="Biloxi%2C%20Mississippi"&gt;Biloxi, Mississippi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Del%20Rio%2C%20Texas"&gt;Del Rio, Texas&lt;/a&gt;, sadèrèngipun kondur dhateng &lt;a href="California"&gt;California&lt;/a&gt; sadangunipun 9 taun. Alba ageng ing kulawarga konservatif, taksih nyepeng tradhisi, agaminipun &lt;a href="Katulik"&gt;Katulik&lt;/a&gt;, lan kulawarga &lt;a href="Latin%20Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Latin Amérika&lt;/a&gt;.
