 Ibunipun Paula namanipun Lorraine M. (née Rykiss), satunggalipun tiyang Yahudi &lt;a href="Kanadha"&gt;Kanadha&lt;/a&gt; lan aslinipun saking &lt;a href="Minnedosa%2C%20Manitoba"&gt;Minnedosa&lt;/a&gt;, Manitoba, ing tapal wates nagari &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ukraina"&gt;Ukraina&lt;/a&gt;.
